{ <const> on a multidimensional declaration was dropped by the parser, so an assignment to an
  element of a const NDArray compiled. It is rejected like one to a const array. }

// EXPECT_ERROR Cannot reassign value to constant variable <ND>

on init
    declare const ND[2, 2] := (1, 2, 3, 4)
    ND[0, 0] := 9
    message(ND[1, 1])
end on
